WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.580
In 1975, an engineer at Kodak
built the first digital camera.

2
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.380
Kodak was the giant of camera film.

3
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:12.490
In January 2012, it filed
for bankruptcy protection.

4
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.540
Digital photography, and
then smartphone cameras,

5
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.140
had replaced film.

6
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.900
Can a new idea that wipes
out whole industries

7
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.510
still leave an economy better off?

8
00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:27.020
In this mission, you'll separate inventing
an idea from bringing it to market,

9
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.210
and watch a new process
move a firm's costs.

10
00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.730
Then you'll ask whether
giant firms or fierce rivals

11
00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:36.140
do more to drive new ideas.

12
00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.340
Your mission: weigh up
who wins and who loses

13
00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.720
when new ideas replace old ones.
